      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH DEGREES (1) goes very well at the course and distance with four wins and a placing from seven starts. Scored by half a length last time (23.23) in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Has the ability and should feature. HUXLEY'S ROCKET (4) was a winner (23.04) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Great chance to atone. FASCINATE JOSIE (5) was a strong winner (22.98) from box 3 last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths at this track. Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Leading chance again. ZIPPING KLIMENKO (2) cannot be ruled out.",
